#. native-sha256: 768ffb30dc3952cc191d49d645da9f9ef6522a1a7f5bc3041da84f60b17ebfb9
#. default-sha256: 4409ba714d567e1cedd2bc89139659aad14f9289370e6df406056b1189cf4480
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_73865939_F219_4430_A7A9_203F1AD34BD1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫⟪k:21⟫⟪k:22⟫⟪k:23⟫⟪k:24⟫⟪k:25⟫⟪k:26⟫⟪k:27⟫⟪k:28⟫⟪k:29⟫⟪k:30⟫⟪k:31⟫⟪k:32⟫⟪k:33⟫"
"⟪k:34⟫⟪k:35⟫⟪k:36⟫⟪k:37⟫⟪k:38⟫⟪k:39⟫⟪k:40⟫⟪k:41⟫⟪k:42⟫⟪k:43⟫⟪k:44⟫⟪k:45⟫⟪k:46⟫⟪k:47⟫⟪k:48⟫⟪k:49⟫"
"⟪k:50⟫⟪k:51⟫⟪k:52⟫⟪k:53⟫⟪k:54⟫⟪k:55⟫⟪k:56⟫⟪k:57⟫⟪k:58⟫⟪k:59⟫⟪k:60⟫⟪k:61⟫⟪k:62⟫⟪k:63⟫⟪k:64⟫⟪k:65⟫"
"⟪k:66⟫⟪k:67⟫⟪k:68⟫⟪k:69⟫⟪k:70⟫⟪k:71⟫⟪k:72⟫⟪k:73⟫⟪k:74⟫⟪k:75⟫⟪k:76⟫⟪k:77⟫⟪k:78⟫⟪k:79⟫⟪k:80⟫⟪k:81⟫"
"⟪k:82⟫⟪k:83⟫⟪k:84⟫⟪k:85⟫⟪k:86⟫⟪k:87⟫⟪k:88⟫⟪k:89⟫⟪k:90⟫⟪k:91⟫⟪k:92⟫⟪k:93⟫⟪k:94⟫⟪k:95⟫⟪k:96⟫⟪k:97⟫"
"⟪k:98⟫It had been several days since I left the capital,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫首都を出たのは数日前。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_33F331FB_3B9E_4EA0_8FAD_EE5D288F0047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7368e0de0652decdfc0822877d88ea7c6e7fdb46c8d22bb28ffdce8069a710a0
#. default-sha256: bd94c7f1306ee0fc1d0351cfbb6bcba2b113c831701589adeee22c49e68d1dae
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_33F331FB_3B9E_4EA0_8FAD_EE5D288F0047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and I could still see it when I closed my eyes—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the people lined up on the Grand-"
"Pont, awaiting entry, eager to start a new life there. Brimming with hope."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫目を閉じると今でも思い出せる。⟪k:1⟫グラン・ポン＜大橋＞には、⟪k:2⟫首都へ引っ越す人の列があっ"
"て――みんな希望に満ちた表情をしていた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C39F9F6A_183B_4DDB_A881_45B70456269D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6a4c9890a66068b0deaa55f64c1ac8d115fa4ee3b589068cb56aa841014a6589
#. default-sha256: 0063a072523e9d73b657dc76b0833bcb5084adb46f8dbb5e8a4498ca4263f777
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C39F9F6A_183B_4DDB_A881_45B70456269D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was a city people were willing to pay high taxes to live in. ⟪k:1⟫If you were a "
"performer, you could get some of those costs shaved down a bit by putting those skills to use."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫高い税金を支払っても入りたい都、⟪k:1⟫芸人であればいくつかの芸を披露して免税を得る……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_26677462_ADE3_4BCD_9D74_5E3630194480
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 57e453b05b9a59760f05a8d00b12b4d510196d564a890930c18f3b00ff19b74e
#. default-sha256: 97f8fb65a6d1733f754e658a4cdd4b5ea07226121ce1db93b116daebfa8e46e6
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_26677462_ADE3_4BCD_9D74_5E3630194480"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The capital was harsh on those who wanted in, and apathetic about all who left."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫入る人間には厳しく出る人間には、⟪k:1⟫見向きもしない。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫それが首都。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_02C0E224_2F80_400F_9C6C_FAF317D2E77B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 485be8e7a21fb08d5cc8bc8a4a27536086b47d802c44fee5c1e2480064f963d8
#. default-sha256: d27a62dc6094af37451c83043d54dbc85b7aff55837dadaf2122c4d12427f2eb
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_02C0E224_2F80_400F_9C6C_FAF317D2E77B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was composed of a powerful nobility and clergy,⟪k:1⟫wealthy merchants and bankers, and a "
"large population of poor.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And it was the city I had called home for a long time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫貴族、⟪k:1⟫誉れある市民権を得た民、⟪k:2⟫商人、⟪k:3⟫そして大多数の貧民からなる街。⟪k:4⟫けれ"
"ど、⟪k:5⟫そこがわたしの、⟪k:6⟫長い間居場所としていた所で……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_0D8680B1_13DD_4A05_BAC7_9E3F46D46FE1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 05d8997eab28b5010e9e758abb23d849dd8cde9abb66e1727882e17c2de4f147
#. default-sha256: 41b8bce2e5976fab1ef57a2bc7a80e92826e3e5a03738c2a1271f7b91718d0b9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_0D8680B1_13DD_4A05_BAC7_9E3F46D46FE1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I didn’t know much about where I was heading."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫これから向かう場所については、⟪k:1⟫詳しく知らなかった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_243EDDDE_2A71_471E_9D8D_F337753DCE30
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 890c015dfc455f015b1f655987dfc98ee55ad79a43e316c71d6ff3cd9d509eb4
#. default-sha256: b9d9bd064f18cacf5b0b0c4be9edf89f4434a719a745d4280710e8c85c27246a
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_243EDDDE_2A71_471E_9D8D_F337753DCE30"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It’s getting foggy.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Looks like it might rain..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫霧が……出てきていますね。⟪k:3⟫雨が降りそう……。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F230F2D6_8532_49D3_A3DF_12B864EF04DC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 61a3011ffda55d3709df221436f542dfb86e7e738d3ba8da8bc6d5c1158bd4bc
#. default-sha256: 0962c3110c642e60dee3ee5d669522f957b454c748d7d24440385c061bea1f00
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F230F2D6_8532_49D3_A3DF_12B864EF04DC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maybe we should take a little break.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You want to keep going? ⟪k:3⟫Oh... ⟪k:4⟫all "
"right, then."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫少し休まないんですか？⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫あら、⟪k:3⟫もう少し？　⟪k:4⟫そう……そうですか。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C4A27F9D_E130_4C26_A5E3_DE9EB7EFA48A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 46ab3a1c772b26e1275b7fc78c53986080c0d14d8d09b9bfe939a32043f1c108
#. default-sha256: fc122a73e97e4f69356774d6595a6be656edf2b78fda22f7a2d31f874f694070
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C4A27F9D_E130_4C26_A5E3_DE9EB7EFA48A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The coachman was frustratingly taciturn.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He acted as though he had gotten stuck "
"transporting a prisoner."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫御者はひどく無口だった。⟪k:1⟫まるで囚人を監獄へと届け送る役目を負っているみたいに。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_558A6AD7_0E76_4ACA_A939_D04D8B50B6CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3f91d9acb0ddfbb6a8419911102a00ef3aca46cc9b3572ccf06f79d49a3b02f9
#. default-sha256: d7bd4824b99d89ed8d097b67fd2b5827fb610fac506b20955f1c013de3692248
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_558A6AD7_0E76_4ACA_A939_D04D8B50B6CD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though that was hardly a stretch.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫From his point of view, I was nothing more than a "
"criminal."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫事実そうなのかもしれない。⟪k:1⟫御者にとっては、⟪k:2⟫わたしなど罪人に過ぎないのだ。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_BB19F393_A642_451F_8F7D_F2176A9002B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 504aae4212801c47cbea4ac654fb4b6bb6d3a6aebb17a8e8139f5e21946d45d9
#. default-sha256: b303e18237e67a58dde22821e1333c935945e8f9605fddbc3089b35108652fd7
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_BB19F393_A642_451F_8F7D_F2176A9002B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Even the times he ⟪k:1⟫would⟪k:2⟫ acknowledge I had said anything,⟪k:3⟫he made no effort to "
"hide the scorn in his eyes—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫声をかけて、⟪k:1⟫時折振り返ってもらっても。⟪k:2⟫その瞳には、⟪k:3⟫ありありと軽蔑や侮蔑が浮かん"
"でいるのだから。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_B8E68FA2_A545_4169_9059_9C36AD382CAC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de7489ef873f381d6c11b49faea47d4aada9c8862e4d638b43bde76fa6b47677
#. default-sha256: 9bd30b4f844e12c82a8283c484632952126275d09c120b9b7e250975db19283c
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_B8E68FA2_A545_4169_9059_9C36AD382CAC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And I would just fall silent again."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫嫌な仕事を引き受けてしまったと――そう言わんばかりの態度。⟪k:1⟫それに、⟪k:2⟫わたしは何も言うこ"
"とが出来ない。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D22A8F79_4093_4ECA_A424_A935EA9A4C11
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ea0379abd2c4e29ac353f07badabe55f404fc2ed3b8c29f0eaf8059fd410636a
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D22A8F79_4093_4ECA_A424_A935EA9A4C11"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_43D63C0F_8592_41D8_900A_AA88FCBA99B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 40eb30931f1c9bbe163fcf56f3eb98dbbecc0ab35373e06a7e7d5b959d0d299f
#. default-sha256: 49191a9633d9a9e4013d69c6f9a41fa539935c59dff7e13164fd7488e8918f39
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_43D63C0F_8592_41D8_900A_AA88FCBA99B4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The road was gradually getting narrower. ⟪k:1⟫We had long since left the paved city roads "
"behind, and were now traveling along a couple worn-down grooves in the forest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫道はどんどん狭くなった。⟪k:1⟫石畳の敷かれた街道はとうに消えていた。⟪k:2⟫今走るのは、⟪k:3⟫た"
"だ、⟪k:4⟫森を伐採しただけの、⟪k:5⟫土がむき出しの道。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_700D2A4A_0C2C_41DC_BD73_97D66A1EE5E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 039d05dcb5c28155d3129048b4d79e725258241a6b5b1a19e2a7b648655d687d
#. default-sha256: 97c676b39d5ed5cd4bae05b7339ec9767f611c72336b40157bf74fb0c13de812
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_700D2A4A_0C2C_41DC_BD73_97D66A1EE5E4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How did I end up here?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうしてこんなことになったのか――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_EC5CA542_9964_464C_8906_7088635DD6F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ac28a8fdf5f6dd6212481740361b885c32bf82294cb28db9aac47ce53295bf5
#. default-sha256: b77ae1432a3fcfec4c71a035b45b357d66d305d6026cbc78e815544b3ee0cd9f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_EC5CA542_9964_464C_8906_7088635DD6F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Why was I being subjected to this?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫どうしてこんな目に遭っているのか――"

#: scenario5:scenario5_F1EA44A1_5550_4484_8F5E_5BEED899409A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 25de24871da31aa30cd8b7eb1bdded3649921bfcf9427c07e984c87b4e056412
#. default-sha256: d10b56fbb8e05025a12cd458f7eb9af9c12cee2bcf0fd54f3b54c7f80d09494e
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_F1EA44A1_5550_4484_8F5E_5BEED899409A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I was done thinking about it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……考えるのは、⟪k:1⟫やめた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_949B46C1_BD03_4443_B59F_6A51F6E99047
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 47579029e236b30fb30c85864051e42fc0da94d94688d1ee8525e860ccf6d00d
#. default-sha256: 7e7aee654250014e987bf32682cf5ad2e0f6233e734343d747e9a103076ffc39
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_949B46C1_BD03_4443_B59F_6A51F6E99047"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more I thought on it, the less fair it seemed.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The more I remembered, the worse "
"it hurt."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫考えれば考えるほど理不尽で。⟪k:1⟫思い出せば思い出すほど苦痛でしかないから。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_D10A655E_0014_49DF_B57A_4464CB59EE1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d88aaf322e76b122e8f61fe7c72c7a7a420d432c1451e6ca58f775b75db80ca5
#. default-sha256: ae1fb5d8861afb88e4570455c7273d5d5604d1188e1984270cc7b4b4076b4f03
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_D10A655E_0014_49DF_B57A_4464CB59EE1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I could do anymore was close my eyes and weather the storm."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫もう、⟪k:1⟫目を瞑って……やり過ごすしか、⟪k:2⟫方法がなかった。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_FC1D2D85_AF57_4F40_9F84_7C36761A027F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a684313d7ad9d39e62d87bc4aa63fa97dfa03e6588b6a3b5053cc94b267c9f56
#. default-sha256: 96d0ac2dde80954e0dd33ed6e8c5c8717d1165e74f6379b2fb5561dec0e65d15
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_FC1D2D85_AF57_4F40_9F84_7C36761A027F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Deep within the dense woods, a mansion appeared before us like the world fading into view "
"after a dream."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫その館は、⟪k:1⟫鬱蒼と茂る森の中から、⟪k:2⟫寝起きざまのように忽然と現れた。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A799B4C7_858A_400E_BCC4_6CAF6CD70413
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab4f3271c7e5f731a2e1c405404db93a16910b314a081903103ea3bc9e54765e
#. default-sha256: e86b103faf048828ed4f503ce523c64160528ee726eaebdd55e36ec61ea62b14
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A799B4C7_858A_400E_BCC4_6CAF6CD70413"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It didn’t seem to be an especially large house, but it had obviously been constructed with a "
"great deal of care, and it was, thankfully, not standing in ruins."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫そう大規模なお屋敷には見えなかったけれど、⟪k:1⟫造りは丁寧で、⟪k:2⟫廃墟ではないと知らされる。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A3788015_73C0_4F3F_B586_E9C643EA713F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 92f349d3ff04eaffd6eb5d5edd1ee0b866bb9db9585b89c1b6530c76e630a65c
#. default-sha256: 273360a9fe8c2b983e7cdda397bbe2e26c13fd365d24ff922b14656bf4e14d28
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_A3788015_73C0_4F3F_B586_E9C643EA713F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫This deep in the forest?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫こんな森の奥に……？"

#: scenario5:scenario5_C490A16F_85CA_4E34_9DE0_E0DD31A4FD62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4528b87b93fbeccfb77d2d6be05ae30aa29a2ffdb7685deec16cc5b252e61efc
#. default-sha256: 573eae484182813969b667275a54bc850917dfd98cbb87fb880ba149a2b7330f
msgctxt "scenario5:scenario5_C490A16F_85CA_4E34_9DE0_E0DD31A4FD62"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The carriage came to a stop, and the coachman climbed down, signaling with his chin for "
"me to get out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫やがて馬車が止まった。⟪k:2⟫御者が先に降りて、⟪k:3⟫顎でただ、⟪k:4⟫降りろと示す。"

#: scenario5:scenario5_A2CBB44E_DE6C_4EA0_989D_489BCD9DEE67
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
